//!
//! The Pathland SwiftUI-style view DSL. Core components (`VStack`, `HStack`,
//! `Text`) and chainable modifiers (`spacing`, `padding`, `font_size`, `color`,
//! `background`) build a retained **view tree** (`Node`) that
